failure.message:
System.ArgumentException : To pass a value to a SupplyParameterFromQuery parameter, use the NavigationManager and navigate to the URI.
For example:

var uri = NavigationManager.GetUriWithQueryParameter(\"descriptive\", \"True\");
NavigationManager.NavigateTo(uri);

